# Reasoning trace

Render only the public trace projection through the injected trace service.
The host runtime invokes the compatibility dispatcher with the exact command
name `reasoning-trace`; no chain-of-thought, transcript, or raw tool data is
read.

Fixed control boundary:

`${PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/launch.sh control codex`

The source seam is:

`opensocrates.application.compatibility.dispatch_compatibility("reasoning-trace", services=...)`
